---
import { Phone, Mail, MapPin, ArrowUpRight, CalendarCheck } from '@lucide/astro';
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { nav, site, mapsLink, bookingEngine } from '../data/site';
import { url } from '../lib/url';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="grain relative overflow-hidden bg-thermal-950 pb-28 text-travertine-100 lg:pb-0">
  <div class="container-x relative pt-24 lg:pt-32">
    <div class="grid gap-14 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-10">
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <Logo id="logo-footer" class="text-travertine-50" />
        <p class="mt-7 max-w-sm text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-travertine-100/65">
          Hotel de trei stele în inima stațiunii Băile Herculane, cu bază proprie de tratament, bazin cu apă
          termo-sulfuroasă de la sursă și camere cu vedere spre Munții Domogled.
        </p>
        <a
          href={bookingEngine}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="mt-8 inline-flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-travertine-100/10 bg-travertine-100/[0.04] p-4 text-sm text-travertine-100/80 transition-colors hover:border-copper-400/40 hover:text-travertine-50"
        >
          <CalendarCheck size={20} stroke-width={1.5} class="mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-copper-400" />
          <span>Tarifele și camerele libere se văd în programul de rezervări al hotelului.</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <h3 class="eyebrow eyebrow-light font-sans">Contact</h3>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-[0.95rem]">
          <li>
            <a href={mapsLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="group flex gap-3 text-travertine-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-travertine-50">
              <MapPin size={18} stroke-width={1.5} class="mt-1 shrink-0 text-copper-400" />
              <span>{site.address.street}<br />{site.address.city}, {site.address.county}<br />{site.address.zip}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={site.phoneHref} class="flex items-center gap-3 text-travertine-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-travertine-50">
              <Phone size={18} stroke-width={1.5} class="shrink-0 text-copper-400" />
              {site.phone}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={site.phone2Href} class="flex items-center gap-3 text-travertine-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-travertine-50">
              <Phone size={18} stroke-width={1.5} class="shrink-0 text-copper-400" />
              {site.phone2}
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`} class="flex items-center gap-3 break-all text-travertine-100/80 transition-colors hover:text-travertine-50">
              <Mail size={18} stroke-width={1.5} class="shrink-0 text-copper-400" />
              {site.email}
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="eyebrow eyebrow-light font-sans">Explorați</h3>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-3 text-[0.95rem]">
          <li><a href={url('/')} class="link-underline text-travertine-100/80 hover:text-travertine-50">Acasă</a></li>
          {
            nav.map((item) => (
              <li>
                <a href={url(item.href)} class="link-underline text-travertine-100/80 hover:text-travertine-50">
                  {item.label}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-3">
        <h3 class="eyebrow eyebrow-light font-sans">Bun de știut</h3>
        <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
          <div>
            <p class="text-travertine-100/65">Check-in</p>
            <p class="font-serif text-lg text-travertine-50">{site.checkIn}</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-travertine-100/65">Check-out</p>
            <p class="font-serif text-lg text-travertine-50">{site.checkOut}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-[0.95rem] text-travertine-100/70">
          Acces gratuit la bazinul termal, la saună și la sala de fitness, pentru oaspeții hotelului.
        </p>
        <a
          href={bookingEngine}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="arrow-link mt-6 whitespace-nowrap text-copper-300 hover:text-copper-200"
        >
          Disponibilitate și tarife
          <ArrowUpRight size={15} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-20 flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-6 border-t border-travertine-100/10 py-8 text-xs text-travertine-100/65 md:flex-row md:items-center">
      <p>© {year} {site.name} ***, Băile Herculane. Toate drepturile rezervate.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2">
        <a href={site.bookingComUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-travertine-50">
          Booking.com <ArrowUpRight size={13} />
        </a>
        <a href={url('/informatii-utile')} class="hover:text-travertine-50">Informații utile</a>
        <a href="https://anpc.ro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 hover:text-travertine-50">
          ANPC <ArrowUpRight size={13} />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none select-none overflow-hidden">
    <p class="whitespace-nowrap text-center font-serif text-[15vw] leading-[0.82] tracking-[-0.04em] text-travertine-100/[0.05]">
      Hotel <span class="italic-serif">Internațional</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
